<div class="text guide-styles" data-units-dynamic="article" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Protection Warrior Tank in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Dragon Soul, Firelands, Twilight Protocol Dungeons, and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c1">Best in Slot Gear for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 4</span></h2>
<div class="box" data-level="null" style="display: block;">
<ul class="first">
<li class="fa fa-check">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Our new goals for gearing in <b>Cataclysm</b> are:</b>
<ol class="last">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Use the highest item level items in every slot to increase our <b>Strength</b>, <b>Stamina</b> and <b>Armor</b> for maximum Effective Health and threat in the form of Attack Power and a higher <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=93098/vengeance">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_shieldofvengeance.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vengeance</span></a> ceiling.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Prefer items with <b>Mastery</b> as a secondary stat, or reforge to mastery whenever possible, until full <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-stat-priority-attributes-pve#survival">Combat Table Coverage</a> is achieved.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Maintain a good balance between <b>Dodge</b> and <b>Parry</b> ratings now that they share similar diminishing returns <i>(with a slight 8% skew in favor of parry rating due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=84621/hold-the-line">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_bg_defendxtowers_av.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hold the Line</span></a>)</i>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Expertise</b> and <b>Hit</b> ratings are not mandatory since threat is rarely a concern, and any secondary stat that isn't contributing to the Combat Table Coverage is detrimental to our survivability.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Ignore <b>Critical strike</b> and <b>Haste</b> ratings that have low value for TPS/<wbr/>DPS.</div></li></ol></div></li></ul>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<a class="cta-button" data-border="strong" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/warrior/protection/tank-stat-priority-attributes-pve">Protection Warrior Stat Priority and Attributes</a></div></div>
<ul>
<li class="fa fa-question">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>How good is the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=-485">Protection Warrior Tier 13 set</a>?</b></div></li>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">2 pieces: <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=105908">Your <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=6572/revenge">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_revenge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Revenge</span></a> ability now also grants a <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=105909">physical absorption shield</a> equal to 20% of the damage done by <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=6572/revenge">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_revenge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Revenge</span></a> to its primary target.</a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">4 pieces: <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=105911">Your <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=871/shield-wall">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_shieldwall.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shield Wall</span></a> ability now grants 50% of its effect to all party and raid members.</a></div></li></ul>
<li class="fa fa-arrow-right">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">The pool of items in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> is very limited compared to previous raids. As a result, your T13 pieces are always the best, and oftentimes the only choice for your armor slots. So you will have these set bonuses whether you actively choose to pursue them or not.<br/>The <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=105908">2p bonus</a> grants you a ~3.5k <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=105909">physical damage absorption shield</a> every time you use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=6572/revenge">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_revenge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Revenge</span></a>, which doesn't mitigate a whole lot of damage relative to 75k-95k incoming swings in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> and leads to a mere ~1% incoming damage reduction. The <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=105911">4p bonus</a> however shares your <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=871/shield-wall">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_shieldwall.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shield Wall</span></a> damage reduction to the entire raid at a 50% potency which can be clutch to cheese raid mechanics and is a unique asset of <span class="c1">Protection</span> <a class="icontiny c1" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=1/warrior">
<img alt="Warrior" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a>
<span class="c1">s</span> this phase.</div></li></ul>
