<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Protection Warrior Tank</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-protection-warrior-tank">Head for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78689/colossal-dragonplate-faceguard">
