<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> so it is the best option by default.<br/>The catch-up helmet <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77156/jaw-of-repudiation">
