<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-protection-warrior-tank">Waist for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The ilvl 410 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78452/gorionas-collar">
<img alt="Goriona's Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Goriona's Collar</span></a> is the best belt for Phase 4 despite the lack of mastery by virtue of being of a higher item level than the alternative tank belts which comes with much higher stamina. In the meantime, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77186/forgesmelter-waistplate">
<img alt="Forgesmelter Waistplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Forgesmelter Waistplate</span></a> bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is a great second choice with better secondary stats and gem sockets that slots nicely between the ilvl 410 and ilvl 397 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77239/gorionas-collar">
<img alt="Goriona's Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Goriona's Collar</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The other ilvl 410 belt <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78416/runescriven-demon-collar">
<img alt="Runescriven Demon Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runescriven Demon Collar</span></a>, despite its high item level, is merely an upgrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71443/uncrushable-belt-of-fury">
<img alt="Uncrushable Belt of Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Uncrushable Belt of Fury</span></a> from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> because of DPS-oriented secondary stats and haste having close to no value at all for a <span class="c1">Protection</span> <a class="icontiny c1" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=1/warrior">
<img alt="Warrior" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a>, and it's best left to plate DPS in your raid.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a>
