<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-protection-warrior-tank">Legs for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>Despite the lack of mastery and mediocre gem sockets, the T13 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78705/colossal-dragonplate-legguards">
<img alt="Colossal Dragonplate Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Colossal Dragonplate Legguards</span></a> are the best legs by default by virtue of being of a higher item level than the alternatives with nearly 15% more stats.<br/>Or alternative I should say, since the only other pair of leg armors for this phase is the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=164/blacksmithing">
<img alt="Blacksmithing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_blacksmithing.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blacksmithing</span></a> craft <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71984/foundations-of-courage">
<img alt="Foundations of Courage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Foundations of Courage</span></a>. Despite better secondary stats and much better gem sockets and bonuses, it's only a second choice between the ilvl 410 and ilvl 397 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=76991/colossal-dragonplate-legguards">
<img alt="Colossal Dragonplate Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Colossal Dragonplate Legguards</span></a>. But what a great second choice if you are getting a late 410 token!<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71720/drakehide-leg-armor">
