<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-protection-warrior-tank">Feet for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78431/stillheart-warboots">
<img alt="Stillheart Warboots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stillheart Warboots</span></a> are the only tank boots that drop in the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> raid and the best choice by default. They come with great secondary stats and gem sockets and are a significant upgrade compared to last phase's boots, even the humble ilvl 384 ones.<br/>
<br/>Although they also have great stats by virtue of being an ilvl 410 item, the DPS-oriented <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78389/treads-of-crushed-flesh">
<img alt="Treads of Crushed Flesh" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Crushed Flesh</span></a> are a downgrade to the ilvl 397 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77246/stillheart-warboots">
<img alt="Stillheart Warboots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stillheart Warboots</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77171/bladeshatter-treads">
<img alt="Bladeshatter Treads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bladeshatter Treads</span></a> bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> so they are best left to the plate DPS in your raid.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a>
