<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-protection-warrior-tank">Main Hand Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78479/souldrinker">
<img alt="Souldrinker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Souldrinker</span></a> is pretty much the only weapon a <span class="c1">Protection</span> <a class="icontiny c1" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=1/warrior">
<img alt="Warrior" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warrior.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warrior</span></a> cares about in Phase 4. It's the best tank weapon by a long shot thanks to its superior item level by virtue of being a <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=56173/deathwing">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Deathwing</span></a> drop with higher primary stats. Plus, it comes with a neat 15% chance to proc a <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=109831/drain-life">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_lifedrain02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drain Life</span></a> effect which in itself contributes to 4% of your damage dealt and up to +1.5k HPS.<br/>
<br/>It's so good in fact that even its lower ilvl 390 version, which can be bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>s before even stepping into your first <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> raid, is on par with other ilvl 410 one-handers from the raid such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78371/hand-of-morchok">
<img alt="Hand of Morchok" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_1h_deathwingraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hand of Morchok</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78414/electrowing-dagger">
<img alt="Electrowing Dagger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Electrowing Dagger</span></a>, as well as the best weapon from last phase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71406/mandible-of-bethtilac">
<img alt="Mandible of Beth'tilac" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mandible of Beth'tilac</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
