<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="ranged-weapons-for-protection-warrior-tank">Ranged Weapons for Protection Warrior Tank</h4>As always, the ranged slot carries the lowest amount of stats of any item slots and thus the difference between ranged weapons is marginal at best. <br/>The ilvl 397 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77085/unexpected-backup">
<img alt="Unexpected Backup" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_thrown_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unexpected Backup</span></a> is a small 4% upgrade to the ilvl 391 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71592/deflecting-star">
<img alt="Deflecting Star" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_thrown_1h_firelandsraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deflecting Star</span></a>, which itself is a 2.5% upgrade to the quest reward <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=72873/bronze-blaster">
<img alt="Bronze Blaster" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_firearm_2h_rifle_430future_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bronze Blaster</span></a> from the new <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5789/end-time">
<span class="tinyicontxt">End Time</span></a> dungeon.<br/>While the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77085/unexpected-backup">
<img alt="Unexpected Backup" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_thrown_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unexpected Backup</span></a> is easy to acquire with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, only buy this item last since it's an insignificant upgrade and a poor usage of your <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> compared to pretty much any other slot.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Scope</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59595/r19-threatfinder">
